<title>HONG KONG: APT Satellite sets HK IPO price at HK$13.40/share.</title>
<headline>APT Satellite sets HK IPO price at HK$13.40/share.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Satellite service provider APT Satellite Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it has set the offering price for its Hong Kong initial public offering (IPO) at HK$13.40 per share.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that its Hong Kong share offering was 65.5 percent subscribed and the issue price set below an indicative range of HK$15.31 to HK$17.71 per share.</p>
</text>
